<title>USA: San Antonio, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>San Antonio, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said it won $2.730 million of San Antonio, Texas, special assessment revenue refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.65 percent.</p>
